=================================================
# Notes                                         #
=================================================
No tabs \ leading whitespace in actual format (just using to show grouping).



=================================================
# Format                                        #
=================================================
<header>
Object <name>:
	Bounds:
		B <scale>
	Materials:
		C <color>
	Normals:
		N <direction>
		...
	Vertices:
		V <position>
		...
	Surface <name>:
		Material:
			P <mat-idx>
		Faces:
			F <norm-idx> <vert-idxs> <center> <size> <dims>
			...
		Raster:
			R <faceidx> <count> <position_1> ... <position_c>
			...
		SVO:
			M <level> <position> <dims>
			...
	...
...



